  "$comment": "The falsifying input for INV-PACK-06. A ledger corrupted on purpose, one planted defect per property, so the test that says V1-V4 pass on the built pack is also made to FAIL — a validator suite that has only ever been run on good data is a suite nobody has checked. Every record here validates against the frozen inter-stage contract in coursekit.artifacts, which the test asserts first: a falsifier that is merely malformed would fail the validators for the wrong reason and prove nothing. The gap list is deliberately EMPTY (every selected_item has gap: false), because V3 and V4's coverage half soften to warnings while a unit still owes G5 slots; this is a FINISHED pack, so they block.",
